        {
          "block_label": "text",
          "block_content": "Young Chinese consumers' consumption of media, and the luxury lifestyle it portrays, is consequently heavily social and trend dependent—a desire to be seen or snapped in the latest styles drives consumption, and with it a need for brands to constantly update their styles or leverage creative marketing to create the illusion of newness.",
